# Observe the Bloodspear's regeneration DURATION, read from the wizard
# "Examine Player Data" dump. Read by tools/check_bloodspear_regen_duration.sh
# and reproduced across the fix by tools/oracle_ab.sh. F41 / inc-tek.8.8.
#
# WHY THE WIZARD DUMP. The regeneration a Bloodspear critical grants shows the
# player only its RATE on the character sheet ("Regeneration (N/round)"), never
# its remaining turns. The turn count -- the value F41 corrects from amt*5 to
# amt*20 -- surfaces only as the REGEN stati's "[Dur N]" in Creature::Dump
# (src/Debug.cpp:1590), reached through wizard "Examine Player Data". Brian ruled
# that dump an acceptable oracle for this fix (2026-08-27).
#
# HOW THE CRIT IS FORCED. The regeneration starts only on a CRITICAL hit by an
# orc wielder. A natural crit cannot be scripted reliably, so this delivers a
# Coup de Grace, which is an automatic critical:
#   1. Wield the Bloodspear (orc form) and ACTIVATE it once to change the
#      longspear into a shortspear -- a longspear has reach and cannot strike an
#      adjacent square, but a Coup de Grace is an adjacent action.
#   2. Read a Scroll of Sleep at an adjacent summoned goblin. Sleep makes it
#      helpless. At SEED 4 the level-1 reader's scroll lands ("The goblin
#      collapses into slumber!"); other seeds miscast or the goblin resists, so
#      this observation is pinned to seed 4.
#   3. Coup de Grace the sleeping goblin (c, g, direction). The automatic
#      critical fires the regeneration ("You feel your blood quicken...").
# The coup's damage is amt; the granted duration is min(amt*20,1000).
#
# ACQUISITION ORDER. Item Acquisition follows lib/m_items.irh, so "Sword of the
# Planes" is the row after the Bloodspear. Scrolls are the second acquisition
# glyph (RIGHT once from Potions); "Scroll of Sleep" sits one row below the row
# where its name first appears, so the extra DOWN lands on it.

@include chargen.keys

# Auto-Identify Items.
w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN
SPACE
ESC

# Acquire and wield the Bloodspear (+2 base; orc form).
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*10
@until "Sword of the Planes" DOWN
ENTER
2
ENTER
b
SPACE
@while "two-handed" n
s
ESC

# Acquire a Scroll of Sleep.
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT
@until "Scroll of Sleep" DOWN
DOWN
ENTER
@while "two-handed" n
s
ESC

w
@choose "Identify Whole Pack"
i
ESC

# Change the longspear into a shortspear so it can strike an adjacent square.
a
a
@dump:after-transform

# Summon a goblin one square east.
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT
ENTER

# Put the goblin to sleep.
r
a
RIGHT
ENTER
@while "Confirm" y
@dump:after-sleep

# Coup de grace the sleeping goblin: an automatic critical that starts regen.
c
g
RIGHT
@while "Confirm" y
@dump:after-coup

# Read the player's stati; the REGEN line carries [Dur N].
w
@choose "Examine Player Data"
DOWN*25
@dump:player-dump
ESC
ESC
@quit
